<title>THAILAND: BOXING-THAILAND'S DAORUNG WINS WBA BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-THAILAND'S DAORUNG WINS WBA BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Daorung Chor Siriwat</p>
<p>won the World Boxing Association (WBA) bantamweight title on</p>
<p>Sunday when he beat defending champion Nana Konadu of Ghana on</p>
<p>points.</p>
<p>Daorung was awarded the contest after the referee stopped</p>
<p>the bout after 10 rounds because of injuries to both fighters, </p>
<p>the judges unanimously declared the Thai the winner.</p>
</text>
